{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52906","headline":"批答安禄山贺雪兼赐口号（题拟） · 玄宗皇帝李隆基","name":"批答安禄山贺雪兼赐口号（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腊月忻三[白]（日），嘉平安四邻。\n预知天下稔，先爲物华春。\n（见上海古籍出版社排印本《安禄山事迹》卷上）（〖1〗《安禄山事迹》：「其〖天宝九载〗冬，久无雪，至十二月十四日乃雪，禄山表贺焉。\n玄宗批答兼口号以赐之曰〖诗略〗。\n其见重如此。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"玄宗皇帝李隆基","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}